  clipPTBR: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f921a3e8cf9ce244ea55d5fbb6cb8e92, type: 3}
  subtitlePTBR: "Este \xE9 o computador da esta\xE7\xE3o. \xC9 aqui que os algoritmos
    ou programas s\xE3o criados. Voc\xEA conhece esses sinais escritos nos cubos,
    certo? Voc\xEAs o chamam de setas, n\xE3o \xE9?"
  clipENUS: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 17008a94bf09efc458e91659e1b71d2f, type: 3}
  subtitleENUS: "This is the station\u2019s computer. This is where algorithms or
    programs are created. You know these symbols written on the cubes, right? You
    call them arrows, don\u2019t you?"
